WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Customers, leads & tags”, then open the “Leads” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Open Leads
Go to Leads to review the opportunities and their stages.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Follow the opportunity
Open the customer, review the conversation and update the stage to match the real outcome.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Connect the external source
When needed, open “Connect an external platform” and use the URL, header and body shown. Keep the connection keys secret.
